        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dr. Dre, Michel'le, Suge Knight\n- Groups: Tha Dogg Pound\n- Companies: Death Row Records\n- Albums: The Chronic, Hung Jury, Dogg Chit\n\nFacts:\n- In 1992, Tha Dogg Pound made its first appearance on Dr. Dre's debut album The Chronic by appearing on several songs.\n- Dr. Dre was previously a co-owner of Death Row Records and an artist on Death Row Records.\n- On August 24, 1998, the album Hung Jury was released on Death Row Records.\n- Hung Jury was produced by Michel'le and Suge Knight.\n- Dogg Chit is the fifth studio album by Tha Dogg Pound.",
